---
title: "{{pkg}}"
image: "/img/{{pkg}}.png"
description: "{{{tagline}}}"
categories: [{{category}}]
tier: {{category}}
lifecycle: {{lifecycle}}
cran: {{cran}}
order: {{order}}
page-layout: full
title-block-style: none
---

::: {.gv-pkg-head}
![](/img/{{pkg}}.png)

::: {.gv-pkg-body}
<div class="gv-chips"><span class="gv-pill gv-pill-{{category_lc}}">{{category}}</span><span class="gv-pill gv-pill-{{lifecycle}}">{{lifecycle}}</span>{{#cran}}<span class="gv-chip" data-gv-cran="{{pkg}}">CRAN <span data-gv="version">…</span></span>{{/cran}}</div>

<h1>{{pkg}}</h1>

[{{{title}}}]{.gv-pkg-tagline}

{{{description}}}

<div class="gv-actions" data-gv-cran="{{pkg}}"><a class="gv-btn gv-btn-primary" data-gv="pkgdown" href="{{github}}" hidden>Documentation</a><a class="gv-btn" href="{{github}}">GitHub</a>{{#cran}}<a class="gv-btn" href="https://CRAN.R-project.org/package={{pkg}}">CRAN</a>{{/cran}}</div>
:::
:::

<div class="gv-tiles" data-gv-repo="{{repo_short}}" data-gv-cran="{{pkg}}">
{{#cran}}
<div class="gv-tile"><span class="gv-tile-value" data-gv="downloads">—</span><span class="gv-tile-label">downloads last month</span></div>
{{/cran}}
<div class="gv-tile"><span class="gv-tile-value" data-gv="stars">—</span><span class="gv-tile-label">GitHub stars</span></div>
<div class="gv-tile"><span class="gv-tile-value" data-gv="issues">—</span><span class="gv-tile-label">open issues</span></div>
<div class="gv-tile"><span class="gv-tile-value" data-gv="pushed">—</span><span class="gv-tile-label">last commit</span></div>
</div>

::: {.gv-pkg-cols}
::: {.gv-col}
## Install

```r
{{#cran}}
# From CRAN
install.packages("{{pkg}}")

{{/cran}}
# Development version
pak::pak("{{repo_short}}")
```
:::

::: {.gv-col}
## Links

<div class="gv-links" data-gv-cran="{{pkg}}">
<a data-gv="pkgdown" href="{{github}}" hidden>Reference and vignettes <small>pkgdown</small></a>
<a href="{{github}}">Source <small>{{repo_short}}</small></a>
<a href="{{github}}/issues">Report an issue <small>issues</small></a>
{{#check}}
<a href="{{github}}/actions">CI status <small>R-CMD-check</small></a>
{{/check}}
{{#cran}}
<a href="https://CRAN.R-project.org/package={{pkg}}">CRAN page <small>cran.r-project.org</small></a>
{{/cran}}
</div>
:::
:::
